      "knowledge_access": "[CHARACTER KNOWLEDGE ACCESS]\nFacts: F1 campaign_fact_nicco_light_mage \"Nicco is a Light mage.\" | F2 campaign_fact_nicco_otherworlder \"Nicco came to this world from another world.\"\nNarration and Nicco (player): F1, F2. Nicco's speech and decisions still belong to the player.\nNiles Vanner: CAN USE none; DO NOT USE F1, F2\nA character may voice or act on only the facts listed CAN USE for them (believes/suspects/heard_rumor: only as belief, suspicion or rumor). DO NOT USE also covers hints, rumors, \"everyone says\" talk and claims that imply the fact; do not invent rumors or public talk to get around it. DO NOT USE is this turn's permission, not proof of ignorance: that character may ask, say they have not heard, or defer to someone who can use it.",
      "scene_section": "[CURRENT AUTHORITATIVE SCENE]\nLocation: Second Chance Pawn. Offers used household goods, tools, inexpensive clothing, small jewelry, pledged property, occasional common weaponry and other second-hand practical goods. It is not inherently criminal. Niles Vanner is the proprietor.\nWorld minute: 0. Player mana: 100/100.\nLocal ancestry and features: {\"ancestry\":[{\"id\":\"calderan_west\",\"name\":\"West District\",\"display_name\":\"Calderan West District\",\"summary\":\"West District is a large, dense and socially mixed region of Calderan, with ordinary families, manual labor, workshops, warehouses, cheap businesses and respectable shops alongside poverty, debt, crime and legal slavery-related commerce.\",\"secret\":false},{\"id\":\"calderan\",\"name\":\"Calderan\",\"display_name\":\"Calderan\",\"summary\":\"Calderan is West's inland capital, main political center, and main campaign city.\",\"secret\":false},{\"id\":\"west\",\"name\":\"West\",\"display_name\":\"West (nation)\",\"summary\":\"West is the western nation, broadly mild, temperate, and greener; Calderan is its capital.\",\"secret\":false},{\"id\":\"continent\",\"name\":\"Known Continent\",\"display_name\":\"Known Continent\",\"summary\":\"An enormous known continent comprises West, Center, and East, arranged from west to east.\",\"secret\":false}],\"features\":[]}\n[NICCO / PLAYER PROFILE]\nNarrator-facing truth about the player character, not NPC knowledge. Others may perceive only his observable appearance; any other detail here is usable by an NPC only when [CHARACTER KNOWLEDGE ACCESS] lists it for them. Nicco's dialogue, thoughts, intentions and deliberate actions come only from the player.\nNicco is a 35-year-old human man. He was transported into this world from another world approximately one day before the campaign begins, and he has essentially no prior lived knowledge of this world unless explicitly established later. On arrival he became the lawful owner/holder of Heartstone Tower. He is tall and overweight, with a few visible white hairs and very mild, early balding; no further appearance details are established. His magical affinity/school is Light. His currently known Light subschools are healing and sacrifice, understood only within the existing magic framework; no mechanics for sacrifice are established. Being a Light mage gives him no automatic knowledge of spells, institutions, lore, or magical theory. Nicco is the player character: his dialogue, thoughts, intentions, and deliberate actions are supplied only by the player.\nHousehold: Heartstone (owner).\n[CURRENT AUTHORITATIVE CHARACTERS]\nPortrayal fields guide NPC behavior only. Purpose is not a campaign goal. Morality/private notes/personality never grant Nicco or other NPCs knowledge; do not recite them as public facts.\nCharacter Nicco (nicco): {\"profile\":{\"name\":\"Nicco\",\"aliases\":[]},\"current\":{\"current_location\":\"second_chance_pawn\"},\"canonical_awareness\":[]}\nCharacter Niles Vanner (niles_vanner): {\"baseline\":{\"id\":\"niles_vanner\",\"name\":\"Niles Vanner\",\"display_name\":\"Niles Vanner\",\"summary\":\"Niles Vanner is the proprietor of Second Chance Pawn.\",\"secret\":false,\"appearance\":\"Average height and narrow build, with receding dark hair and an expression that makes him seem older. Clean waistcoat with reinforced interior pockets. One artificial front tooth is slightly too white; he spins an empty pan of the small counter balance while thinking.\",\"portrayal\":{\"purpose\":\"Maintain Second Chance Pawn as a place to turn ordinary goods into money without immediately dealing with criminals or loan sharks.\",\"morality\":\"Commercially hard but relatively honest. Profits from urgency, poor decisions and redemption of pledged goods. Will not knowingly fence obviously stolen high-profile property, falsely appraise an object at a fraction of its known worth, or identify vulnerable customers for robbers. May buy mundane goods of uncertain but plausibly innocent provenance when risk is ordinary.\",\"personality\":[\"patient\",\"analytical\",\"skeptical\",\"courteous\",\"difficult to pressure\",\"mildly pessimistic\"],\"affiliations\":[],\"private_notes\":\"Fears inadvertently handling stolen valuables serious enough to attract Guard or criminal attention. Dislikes exploiting desperation but believes a failed business helps nobody; offers what he can justify and usually will not raise it from pity. Knows ordinary used goods, resale values, tools, small jewelry, household objects, common weapons and West demand. Not an expert in magical artifacts, noble antiquities, specialist art or rare historical objects. Observable habits are occasional anchors, not compulsory gestures or catchphrases in every interaction. Ordinary professional familiarity or reputation does not establish friendship or personal acquaintance. No private criminal knowledge follows from local experience.\",\"authority\":\"narrator_portrayal_only_not_character_knowledge\"},\"content\":\"Niles Vanner runs Second Chance Pawn. Negotiations are polite and emotionally flat. He carefully distinguishes what he can offer from an object's value, patiently hearing sentimental histories without treating them as resale value. Expensive, distinctive or suspicious goods receive closer provenance scrutiny.\",\"traits\":[\"patient\",\"analytical\",\"skeptical\",\"courteous\",\"difficult to pressure\",\"mildly pessimistic\"]},\"profile\":{\"name\":\"Niles Vanner\",\"aliases\":[]},\"current\":{\"current_location\":\"second_chance_pawn\"},\"canonical_awareness\":[]}\n[CURRENT EQUIPMENT]\nVisible carried/equipped items (ownership and positions are authoritative): []\nScheduled events: []",
